                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "A Real View",
                            "The skylight opens\nonto the shared\npipe chase, which\nNib once",
                            "described as a\nsecluded outlook.\nA buyer asked what\ncould be seen",
                            "there. Nib\nanswered: Three\nvalves and my\nmistake. The buyer\nkept the",
                            "quote and asked\nfor the actual\nmaintenance plan."
                          ],
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 4,
